  "name": {
   "zh": "深度与摄影机 · Depth Anything 3",
   "en": "Depth and Camera · Depth Anything 3"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Depth Anything 3 官方自述：从任意视觉输入预测空间一致的几何，摄影机位姿已知与否都可以；官方称多视图深度估计和位姿估计优于 VGGT。这张卡交付每帧摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机）和深度贴图；不出点云（官方只交深度和摄影机），要点云接「深度转点云」。默认的 Large 权重非商用；商用请把「模型」换成 Base。",
   "en": "Depth Anything 3 describes itself as predicting spatially consistent geometry from any visual input, with or without known camera poses; upstream reports multi-view depth and pose estimation better than VGGT. This card delivers per-frame cameras (USD and Nuke camera) and depth maps; no point cloud (upstream gives only depth and cameras), so wire Points from Depth if you need one. The default Large weights are non-commercial; for commercial use set Model to Base."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_camera",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
